    "content": {
      "type": "policy-content",
      "settings": {
        "content": "<p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> November 22, 2024</p><p>This Cookie Policy explains how <strong>eJuno</strong> (\"we,\" \"us,\" or \"our\") uses cookies and similar tracking technologies to recognise you when you visit our website at [<a href=\"https://eJuno.io/\">https://eJuno.io</a>] (the \"Website\"). It provides details about what cookies are, why we use them, and how you can control their usage.</p><p>In some cases, the data collected through cookies may constitute personal information or become personal information if combined with other data.</p><p><strong>1. What Are Cookies?</strong></p><p>Cookies are small text files placed on your computer or mobile device when you visit a website. They are widely used to make websites function efficiently, enhance user experience, and provide analytics and other reporting information.</p><ul><li><strong>First-party cookies:</strong> Set directly by the website you are visiting.</li><li><strong>Third-party cookies:</strong> Set by external providers for services like advertising, analytics, or embedded content.</li></ul><p></p><p>Third-party cookies enable features such as targeted advertisements and social media integration, recognising your device across multiple websites.</p><p><strong>2. Why Do We Use Cookies?</strong></p><p>We use cookies for several purposes, including:</p><ul><li><strong>Essential Cookies:</strong> To enable core functionality such as security, network management, and accessibility. These are  required for our Website to function.</li><li><strong>Analytics and Customisation   Cookies:</strong> To  understand user behaviour, analyse traffic, and enhance user experience.</li><li><strong>Advertising Cookies:</strong> To deliver relevant  advertisements, limit repeated exposure, and measure the effectiveness of campaigns.</li></ul><p><strong>3. Types of Cookies We Use</strong></p><p>Below is a breakdown of the cookies we use on our Website and their purposes:</p><p><strong>Essential Cookies</strong></p><p>These cookies are necessary for the basic operation of our Website.</p><p></p>"
      }
