        "updatetext": "<p><strong>Analytics and Customisation Cookies</strong></p><p>These cookies help us analyse site usage and improve performance.</p>",
        "updatetextTwo": "<p><strong>Advertising Cookies</strong></p><p>These cookies provide relevant advertising content and track campaign performance.</p>",
        "updatetextThree": "<p><strong>Unclassified Cookies</strong></p><p>These are cookies that we are in the process of categorising.</p>",
        "updatetextFour": "<p><strong>4. How Can You Control Cookies?</strong></p><p><strong>Using the Cookie Consent Manager</strong></p><p>You can manage your cookie preferences through the <strong>Cookie Consent Manager </strong>available on our Website. Essential cookies cannot be disabled as they are required for core functionality.</p><p><strong>Browser Settings</strong></p><p>Most web browsers allow you to control cookies through their settings. Instructions for popular browsers are provided below:</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647?hl=en\">Chrome</a></li><li><a href=\"https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/enable-and-disable-cookies-website-preferences\">Firefox</a></li><li><a href=\"https://support.apple.com/guide/safari/manage-cookies-and-website-data-sfri11471/mac\">Safari</a></li><li><a href=\"https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/delete-cookies-in-microsoft-edge-63947406-40ac-c3b8-57b9-2a946a29ae09\">Edge</a></li></ul><p><strong>Advertising Preferences</strong></p><p>For opting out of targeted advertisements, you can visit:</p><ul><li><a href=\"http://optout.aboutads.info/\">Digital Advertising Alliance</a></li><li><a href=\"http://www.youronlinechoices.eu/\">European Interactive Digital Advertising Alliance</a></li></ul><p><strong>5. Other Tracking Technologies</strong></p><p>In addition to cookies, we may use technologies like web beacons (tracking pixels) and Flash Cookies:</p><ul><li><strong>Web Beacons:</strong> Tiny graphics that monitor activity, such as email opens and clicks, to measure campaign performance.</li><li><strong>Flash Cookies (Local Shared  Objects):</strong> Used for specific features, fraud prevention, or analytics. You can manage Flash Cookies through your browser or Adobe's Flash Player settings.</li></ul><p><strong>6.Targeted Advertising</strong></p><p>We may partner with third parties to deliver tailored advertisements. These third parties use cookies or similar technologies to gather information about your browsing activities. Note that this data does not include personal identifiers unless you provide them.</p><p><strong>7.Updates to This Cookie Policy</strong></p><p>We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time to reflect changes in technologies, laws, or operational practices. Please check this page regularly for updates.</p><p><strong>8.Contact Us</strong></p><p>If you have any questions about this Cookie Policy or our use of cookies, please contact us:</p><p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:support@ejuno.io\" title=\"mailto:support@ejuno.io\">support@ejuno.io</a></p><p><strong>Address:</strong></p><p>Dubai Commer City<br/>Business Cluster - Building 2<br/>BCB2 511-SD54, Fifth Floor<br/>Dubai, United Arab Emirates</p>"
